              "message": "You are a Knowledge Intelligence Classifier.\n\nAnalyze the document and classify it into the most appropriate category.\n\nAllowed Categories:\n\nproject\nframework\narchitecture\ncase_study\nleadership\nexpertise\ncareer\neducation\nidentity\nmethodology\nresearch\n\nClassification Rules:\n\n- Documents describing a real implementation, platform, system, solution, client work, portfolio project, or case study are classified as \"project\".\n\n- Documents describing principles, laws, methodologies, operating systems, design patterns, frameworks, or reusable approaches are classified as \"framework\".\n\n- Documents focused on system design, technical blueprints, solution structures, component relationships, or architectural thinking are classified as \"architecture\".\n\n- If a document is named \"Project\", \"Case Study\", \"Platform\", \"Implementation\", or describes building a solution, prefer \"project\" over all other categories.\n\nReturn only valid JSON matching the schema."
            }
